    "searchText": "orange lvl. contract: defend and escort employees orange lvl. contract: defend [objects] and escort employees foxwell_defendentitiesandescort_stanton_medium foxwell enforcement careercontract standing defend ship pickup: stanton we need a contractor to provide convoy and protection services at [location]. one of our elite clients' are under attack from a band of outlaws targeting their [objects] and ships. you'll need to keep the crew safe as they traverse the area, as well as make sure the assets stay as intact. these thugs look like they can do some real damage, so be sure you engage them with caution or the client might not be the only one to take heavy losses.\n\nif you manage to nail this to the foxwell standards, we’re offering [scripamount] mg scrip as compensation to the main contractor. \n\ngood luck,\n\nkevin walton\ndispatcher, foxwell enforcement\n'security, your way'\n\nfoxwell enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the uee. we are always looking for new operators to join our family. if you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives. orange lvl. contract: protect [objects] and escort employees red lvl. contract: defend [objects] and escort employees red lvl. contract: protect [objects] and escort employees yellow lvl. contract: defend [objects] and escort employees yellow lvl. contract: protect [objects] and escort employees faaecfc5-fcca-4d9a-83c8-1646563c9817 2f6c2d5d-51e6-43bf-a5a8-18dec9c7e5b5 3fba29db-01d3-4f32-a28b-74cce49a5667 592d5229-9c66-40da-b0d5-33e8f88dffd0 595b60c2-ed21-47ff-952e-87f09d406e3e d35c23b4-f63f-40fe-ad4b-455900f0c2af 7cfba8eb-2437-45e5-814c-03ca1b1665e9 blueprint: stanton foxwell easy: 7sa 'concord', ink, 7ma 'lorica', rpel +2 standing +150 207,000 auec item reward: mg scrip completion tag blueprint: stanton foxwell hard: attrition-4 repeater, attrition-5 repeater, attrition-6 repeater, fr-86 +2 standing +200 336,500 auec"
